      "side": 1,
      "message": "@fmalita@google.com Looking more into this scenario, the Gold example shows an inconsistency with SkARGB32_Shader_Blitter where there was under/over flow happening in the matrixProc when converting from fixed 32.32 to 16.16. I added a default clamp to that function. \n\nThis problem still existed when using the rasterpipeline_blitter however, which I think this is a reasonable solution for. By checking our device bounds in shader space, we can see if we will deal with numbers small/large enough that the lowp implementation won\u0027t handle correctly.",
      "parentUuid": "830aeed4_38c72ac5",
      "revId": "2734a9fb7cc62bcc25cfdea4139f7a7a949ab5a5",
